{% comment %}
  Cart drawer top: a free shipping message with a full progress bar, then a navy band when a discount
  (e.g. a bundle deal) is applied to the cart. Rendered under the cart header when the cart has items.
{% endcomment %}
<div class="dd-cart-top">
  <div class="dd-cart-ship">
    <p>Congrats! You've unlocked <strong>FREE SHIPPING!</strong></p>
    <div class="dd-cart-ship__bar" aria-hidden="true"><span></span></div>
  </div>
  {%- if cart.total_discount > 0 -%}
    <div class="dd-cart-band">Limited Time Discount Auto-Applied</div>
  {%- endif -%}
</div>
